# tally 2.1.8 S1 (#177), L §5.19 One movement on two statements, §8.4: rows stated same are one movement whose
# fulfils is stated on either row or on both alike; rows that state different ones (pay[2026-03] and top[2026-03])
# are refused, RUN-RECORD naming both rows in id order, as two unjoined rows that fulfil one instance are. Every read
# of the movement, of the places it books and of either instance's realised movement is refused. 2.1.7 booked it
# (konto 900.00 PLN).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-10
  start 2026-03-01
  end 2026-04-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place sav: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
input bank: observed
input amt: money PLN
input d_p: int

move pay[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, d_p)
  leg cash from konto to sav amount amt

move top[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, d_p)
  leg cash from konto to sav amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  d_p = 10 "s"
  opening[konto] = 1000.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"
  opening[sav] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"

version st_konto
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-02
  covers konto
  bank[a1] = (on: 2026-03-10, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 100.00 PLN, fulfils: pay[2026-03]) "a"

version st_sav
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-03
  covers sav
  bank[b1] = (on: 2026-03-10, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 100.00 PLN, fulfils: top[2026-03]) "b"
  same bank[a1] = bank[b1]

ask k: bal(konto, 2026-03-31)
ask sv: bal(sav, 2026-03-31)
ask o: observed(pay[2026-03]).cash.amount
ask f: flows(top, 2026-03)
=== expect
f: refused: RUN-RECORD bank[a1] and bank[b1] are stated same and fulfil pay[2026-03] and top[2026-03]
  cut 2026-04-10
k: refused: RUN-RECORD bank[a1] and bank[b1] are stated same and fulfil pay[2026-03] and top[2026-03]
  open: pay[2026-03]
  open: top[2026-03]
  cut 2026-04-10
o: refused: RUN-RECORD bank[a1] and bank[b1] are stated same and fulfil pay[2026-03] and top[2026-03]
  cut 2026-04-10
sv: refused: RUN-RECORD bank[a1] and bank[b1] are stated same and fulfil pay[2026-03] and top[2026-03]
  open: pay[2026-03]
  open: top[2026-03]
  cut 2026-04-10
